X21A01 ~r~Haji Gul's man:~w~ A tank in the valley! Second squad, flank it! Call the trucks!
X21A02 The garrison is down. Blow up the ~y~ammunition dump~w~ before they regroup.
X21A03 ~y~Hamid (radio):~w~ Dust on the north road. One more truck is coming fast. Hold the Rhino and finish them.
X21A04 ~g~The camp is quiet. Hamid is calling you back.
